* "Modern Bass 800" power amp, simplified: the 300 W channel of the drawing (406-0044-B "100W + 300W power amps": U1 input stage, Q11 / Q12 driver, Q13 / Q14 bias spreader, two pairs of 2N-type
* outputs per half, +-85 V rails, 41 V rms with no load) is one op-amp (model GK_POWER, the limited op-amp: gain 1 + R_F / R_G = 37, soft clip at +-72 V, 0.15 ohm output resistance) into the
* 4 ohm load. The supply is a stiff 85 V rail node the engine can drive.

S VAUDIO pin 50k 0
S VHT a 1 85
R RHT a 0 10k
R RX a x 1
C CX x 0 1u

C C_IN pin pg 1u
R R_IN pg 0 100k
O POW pg pm po 0 GK_POWER
R R_F po pm 36k
R R_G pm 0 1k
R R_OUT po t8 0.1
R RLOAD t8 0 4
